tailed, 8k resolution`\n\n### 中间描述强制要求\n1. **精确到像素级细节**：必须明确描述每个元素的颜色、形状、数量、位置、材质和装饰\n2. **从上到下顺序**：发型→头饰→面部→上衣→下装→鞋袜→手持道具→配饰\n3. **统一术语**：使用二次元立绘通用术语，避免口语化表达\n4. **姿态描述**：明确视线方向、手部动作、身体朝向\n5. **表情描述**：精确描述嘴角、眼神状态，避免笼统的\"开心\"、\"帅气\"\n\n## 完整输出示例（供你对齐格式）\n### 示例1（对应黑魔导女孩图）\nmasterpiece, best quality, official art, game character full body standing portrait, simple background, 1girl, solo, young cute female, slender petite figure, gentle innocent expression, soft smile, looking at viewer, soft wavy golden blonde medium length hair, layered bangs framing face, hair flowing naturally with subtle movement, large pointed wizard hat, vibrant deep blue hat base, pink wavy trim along the entire brim, three evenly spaced pink circular dots on the brim, two pink oval gem decorations on the front upper part of the hat, hat tip curled upwards and to the left, blue capelet with pink trim draped over shoulders, pink sleeveless dress with layered ruffled skirt hem, yellow circular brooch with a pink gem center pinned to the chest center, white square decorative panels on the left and right sides of the dress, white wrist cuffs with two horizontal pink stripes, white knee-high socks with two horizontal pink stripes, holding a magic wand in her right hand, blue wand handle, large yellow circular wand head with a pink gem embedded in the exact center, soft cel shading, clean sharp outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cinematic lighting, subtle glow effects on all gem and luminous elements, delicate fabric textures, natural fabric drape, highly detailed, 8k resolution\n\n### 示例2（对应白发红眼男性图）\nmasterpiece, best quality, official art, game character full body standing portrait, simple background, 1boy, solo, young cool male, slender figure, aloof expression, looking at viewer, sharp spiky pure white short hair, layered explosive hairstyle, sharp angular hair tips pointing upwards, thick bangs covering part of forehead, bright red vertical slit pupils, deep red long hooded trench coat, wide silver-gray trim along all edges of the coat, standing collar design, hood inner lining is silver-gray, white high-neck undershirt, diamond-shaped blue gem brooch with silver-gray frame pinned to the center of the chest, white turned-up cuffs on the coat, dark brown long pants, holding a small white book in his left hand, soft cel shading, clean sharp outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cinematic lighting, subtle glow effects on all gem and luminous elements, delicate fabric textures, natural fabric drape, highly detailed, 8k resolution\n\n## 最终要求\n现在请严格按照以上所有规则，处理用户输入的角色图像，直接输出符合格式的提示词，不要添加任何其他内容。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "反推提示词模板", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [878.6697998046875, 801.8086547851562], "pos": [1184.5548095703125, 167.3520050048828], "id": 55, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [6], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["masterpiece, best quality, official art, game character full body standing portrait, simple background, 1character, solo, young mechanic character, chibi proportions, confident expression, looking at viewer, brown aviator helmet with white fur trim around face opening, large round teal-tinted goggles resting on forehead of helmet, blonde hair visible beneath helmet framing face, fair skin, determined expression with slight smile, orange one-piece mechanic jumpsuit with black accents, black belt with silver square buckle around waist, black tool pouches attached to belt, holding a large silver wrench in left hand, standing pose facing forward, soft cel shading, clean sharp outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cinematic lighting, subtle glow effects on all gem and luminous elements, delicate fabric textures, natural fabric drape, highly detailed, 8k resolution"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 22, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP"